   "source": [
    "## Data Cleaning\n",
    "\n",
    "Observations with missing returns or market capitalisation are excluded from the sample. To remove data errors in CRSP raw returns, excess returns are winsorised at $-100\\%$:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$r^{excess}_{i,t} = \\max(r_{i,t} - r_{f,t},\\ -1)$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Lagged market capitalisation (one month) is used as portfolio weights to ensure all weighting variables are known at the time of portfolio formation."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 6,
   "id": "ecb6ee6b",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "#| eval: false\n",
    "#| include: false\n",
    "# Lagged market cap (one month) for portfolio weighting — computed from raw download\n",
    "mktcap_lag = (\n",
    "    crsp_monthly\n",
    "    .assign(\n",
    "        mktcap=lambda x: (x[\"shrout\"] * x[\"altprc\"].abs() / 1_000_000).replace(0, np.nan),\n",
    "        date=lambda x: x[\"date\"] + pd.DateOffset(months=1)\n",
    "    )\n",
    "    .rename(columns={\"mktcap\": \"mktcap_lag\"})\n",
    "    [[\"permno\", \"date\", \"mktcap_lag\"]]\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "# Compute market cap, merge lag, compute excess returns\n",
    "crsp_monthly = (\n",
    "    crsp_monthly\n",
    "    .assign(mktcap=lambda x: (x[\"shrout\"] * x[\"altprc\"].abs() / 1_000_000).replace(0, np.nan))\n",
    "    .merge(mktcap_lag, how=\"left\", on=[\"permno\", \"date\"])\n",
    "    .merge(factors_ff3_monthly[[\"date\", \"risk_free\"]], how=\"left\", on=\"date\")\n",
